# The repo previously had a mix of CRLF and LF line endings across
# lib/, test/, and pubspec.yaml with no policy enforcing either - every
# file has now been normalized to LF, and this file keeps it that way so
# a future commit from a different platform/editor doesn't reintroduce
# the mix and its accompanying noisy whole-file diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.xml binary
